\contentsline {paragraph}{Stage 1 Isolated inference latency is not predictive of closed-loop cost.}{25}{section*.11}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{Stage 2 Real closed-loop simulation reveals a catastrophe the isolated benchmark did not predict.}{26}{section*.13}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{Stage 3 Supplying an analytical Jacobian does not resolve the catastrophe.}{26}{section*.14}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{Stage 4 Bypassing \texttt {predict()} with a hand-written forward pass resolves the catastrophe.}{27}{section*.15}%
